      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "NEPTUNITE (8) comes through the Vicbred Super Series where he missed narrowly in the heats before fading out of his semi final. Had won three in a row here prior to take his unbeaten record at this venue to six so will enjoy the class drop and has the talent to overcome the outside barrier. APPLAUDING (4) was powering through her grades at the end of last campaign and went to the paddock off three straight wins here. Has had 11 weeks off but has been readied with two nice trials. SNAP SHOT NZ (6) has been racing at Menangle where she placed at Listed level last month. Suited returning to a venue where she is yet to miss a place. CAPTURE OUR HEART NZ (1) has come from the back row to record a win and a placing in her last two outings and scored here the last time she drew on the pegs.",
